Peking University Thesis (pkuthss) (typage/pkuthss) - license

This template contains files from two sources.

  main.tex, refs.bib, manifest.json, typage.json, LICENSE
      Written by 7D24H. CC0-1.0: dedicated to the public domain; documents
      written from this template need no attribution.
      https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

  pkuthss.cls, pkuthss.def, pkuthss-utf8.def, pkulogo.pdf, pkuword.pdf
      pkuthss 1.9.4 (2024/03/07), the Peking University dissertation
      class, Copyright solvethis, Casper Ti. Vector and Kurapica, under the
      LaTeX Project Public License 1.3 or later, as stated in the package
      README. The logo files show the emblem and name of Peking University,
      for dissertations of that university.

  chap/copy.tex, chap/origin.tex
      The copyright notice and the originality / authorization statement
      pages of the pkuthss example, Copyright solvethis and Casper Ti.
      Vector, under the New BSD License (BSD-3-Clause), whose terms are in
      the file headers.

All seven files are as distributed by CTAN (https://mirrors.ctan.org/install/macros/latex/contrib/pkuthss.tds.zip;
https://ctan.org/pkg/pkuthss) and redistributed unmodified, so that the
template compiles offline.

biblatex, biblatex-caspervector, the fonts (Fandol, XITS, TeX Gyre) and the
other packages come from the built-in Tectonic bundle under their own
licenses; references are processed with the built-in biber 2.17. Check the
current requirements of the Peking University graduate school before
submitting.
